{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumUniverses.HochschildHomology","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumUniverses.HochschildHomology","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Information.CocenterTraceFactor"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumUniverses.traceOnHochschildZero_class","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumUniverses.traceOnHochschildZero_class","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/hochschild-homology.lean#L54-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumUniverses.traceOnHochschildZero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumUniverses.traceOnHochschildZero","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/hochschild-homology.lean#L48-L52","doc":"A cyclic functional `τ` (`τ(ab) = τ(ba)`) descends to `HH_0(A)`: the trace is a\nfunction of the Hochschild class alone. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumUniverses.hochschildClass_mul_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumUniverses.hochschildClass_mul_comm","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/hochschild-homology.lean#L40-L46","doc":"**The degree-zero trace property (sorry-free).** `[a·b] = [b·a]` in `HH_0(A)`,\nbecause `a·b − b·a` generates the commutator submodule. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumUniverses.hochschildClass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumUniverses.hochschildClass","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/hochschild-homology.lean#L34-L36","doc":"The class of `a` in `HH_0(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumUniverses.HochschildZero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumUniverses.HochschildZero","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/hochschild-homology.lean#L31-L32","doc":"**Hochschild homology in degree zero**: the cocenter `HH_0(A) = A / [A, A]`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:hochschild-homology","label":"def:hochschild-homology","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/hochschild-homology.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}